## Session Memory

**Read this ONE file at task start:** `memory/.agent-brief.yaml` — merged working memory + graph scout + tool summaries (~45 lines). Injected automatically on new chats when `agent_brief: true`.

Do **not** also load `memory/state.yaml`, `memory/.graph-scout.yaml`, or `graphify-out/graph.json` unless the brief is missing.

Index → `memory.md` (last 30 sessions). Today → `sessions/` (YAML). Prior days → `sessions/archive/`. Raw rollup → `memory/state.yaml` (hook-maintained; included in brief).

When you finish a turn that changed code, if a session file was created for this chat, append **one line** to `context:` and any `open:` items the **next** agent needs — not prose decisions. Git diff covers *what* changed.

Only add `facts:` bullets when scout flagged HIGH/CRITICAL god nodes.

Manual compress: `python3 .cursor/hooks/compress-memory.py`

